CES and a spacious pantry with barn door. Down the hall is a luxurious main bath with floor-to-ceiling tile, a vessel sink and a washing machine. There's a SEPARATE ENTRANCE to the basement, second kitchen, bedroom, den and laundry area. The high eff. furnace and HWT were installed in 2020. The massive fully fenced backyard is an oasis, featuring a hot tub, concrete patio/sidewalk (2024), fresh sod, and a double detached HEATED GARAGE with the garage doors/openers, roof, windows, man door, and OSB sheathing all done in 2022. There's RV PARKING with a concrete pad and security gate. Power is close by for the RV, and the garage is EV-ready with the wiring already run. This place is a must-see! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$485,000"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","5"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,109 sq ft"],["Lot size","6,870 sq ft"],["Year built","1954"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Dovercourt"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5L4G4"],["MLS® number","E4504959"],["Listed","August 21, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Oven - Built-In, Hood Fan, Window Coverings, Two Washers, Two Refrigerators"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Den","Basement",""],["Primary Bedroom","Main level",""],["Bedroom 2","Main level",""],["Bedroom 3","Main level",""],["Bedroom 4","Basement",""],["Second Kitchen","Basement",""],["Bedroom 5","Basement",""]],"courtesy":"Dustin Racine, Exp Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"dovercourt","area":"northwest-edmonton"}